Q.feminist_trust += 4;
Q.movement_autonomy += 2;
if (Q.abortion_cabinet_deadline) {
    Q.progressives_dissent += 4;
    Q.public_trust -= 1;
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Casework proves partial delivery and the missing statute";
!}

The network publishes where patients can obtain care, which prosecutors still
need answering and which hospitals require legal support. [? if
abortion_law_enacted: With the law already enacted, this is the work that makes
passage real.?][? if not abortion_law_enacted: It protects people now without
pretending casework is the statute the movement was promised.?] [? if
abortion_cabinet_deadline: Organisers accept the renewed funding and record
that the spring vote remains unmet.?]

- @poland_event_queue: File the access audit

@movement_spring_candidates
title: Ratify the organiser slate through open local selections
subtitle: Available only if political representation was promised.
view-if: movement_candidates_promised = 1
on-arrival: movement_followthrough_2025 = "Organiser candidates received open selections"; movement_candidates_promised = 0; local_network += 4; movement_autonomy += 4; feminist_trust += 5; turnout_readiness += 3; barons_dissent += 4; news_headline = "Movement organisers become candidates without surrendering their organisations"

Local members select organisers in open meetings instead of receiving a slate
from headquarters. The candidates keep their movement ties and gain routes
into the Sejm campaign; party barons lose control of safe places they assumed
belonged to the apparatus.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the organiser slate

@movement_spring_breach
title: Admit that the coalition will not deliver before the presidency
subtitle: Honest retreat; severe trust loss, but no invented deadline.
on-arrival: movement_followthrough_2025 = "The post-defeat promise was formally breached"; abortion_cabinet_deadline = 0; movement_candidates_promised = 0; feminist_trust -= 9; progressive_credibility -= 5; movement_autonomy += 2; government_coalition_dissent -= 3; psl_relation += 3; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "The Left admits that its reproductive-rights promise has failed"

Lewica tells the organisations that no spring vote or candidate guarantee will
be delivered before the presidential contest. [? if left_in_government: PSL
welcomes the closed file and the cabinet breathes more easily.?][? if not
left_in_government: Governing parties lose one deadline the opposition could
have used against them.?] The movement leaves furious but free of a promise
designed only to keep it waiting, and begins planning without us.

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the breach in the party record
